  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Qualify bounded provider-neutral LU solve, full-Q Householder QR and analytical 2x2 singular values. Observe an absent-contract RED, then execute 25 independent GREEN oracles, optional managed Math.NET 5.0.0 LU/QR/SVD corroboration, prior Math regressions and isolated numerics NuGet 0.4.0-preview.3 packaging. Complete C03-T1 while keeping C03 and M3 in progress.",
    "value": "Provide inspectable finite-binary64 matrix solve and factorization with explicit singular, rank-deficient, nonfinite and budget outcomes, deterministic LU permutations, QR reconstruction, residual diagnostics and no product dependency on Math.NET.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "Only the accepted M3-W01-C03-T1 task and its RED/GREEN/verification children are completed; C03-T2, C03, M3-W01 and M3 remain incomplete.",
      "The admitted LU and full-Q QR algorithms are dimension-bounded at 16 with declared default relative threshold 1e-12; they do not guarantee robust numerical conditioning for arbitrary inputs.",
      "The public singular-spectrum calculation admits only 2x2 values, not full SVD vectors or pseudoinverses; a full SVD is corroborated exclusively in a managed provider smoke.",
      "Managed Math.NET 5.0.0 is test-only, pinned to prior Win-x64 qualification. No native BLAS, other runtime RID or silent provider loading is admitted.",
      "Do not duplicate generic Discovery attributes, manifests or generated agent skills in this scientific run. Neutral ownership remains with dw.discovery in aihallot/dw.tools.",
      "No AURA or Decision repository mutation, broker authorization, BrokerReady label, public NuGet push or CI release is requested.",
      "Retry 1 replaces all four hand-written JSON authority inspections with bounded Require operations and replaces payload-local SHA-256 recalculation with SDK mutation receipts; provider SVD comparisons are order-independent.",
      "Retry 2 fixes C# CS0234 namespace shadowing by qualifying System.Math calls in the staged product, MSTest cases and independent Math.NET smoke; no capability or DWF scope is broadened."
    ],
    "nextAction": "After durable RS042, qualify C03-T2 rank/pivot and ill-conditioned boundaries, residual/conditioning semantics, provider availability and full-SVD scope before closing C03. Continue observing neutral dw.discovery and Workflow issue 139 independently.",
    "achievements": [
      {
        "projectNode": "M3-W01-C03-T1-R",
        "achievement": "Compile a separate RED against the prior numerical assembly and retain a failed missing-contract oracle before staging the new LU/QR source."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M3-W01-C03-T1-G",
        "achievement": "Deliver bounded finite-binary64 LU with partial pivoting, unique dense solve and residuals, full-Q Householder QR, and an explicitly limited analytical 2x2 singular-value spectrum."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M3-W01-C03-T1-V",
        "achievement": "Prove 25 independent numerical oracles, recovered RED, managed Math.NET 5.0.0 LU/QR/SVD smoke, prior Math regressions, copy contracts and the local provider-neutral NuGet package."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M3-W01-C03-T1",
        "achievement": "Complete the accepted solve, factorization, singular refusal and reconstruction task T1 with durable evidence, leaving the C03 boundary task T2 planned."
      }
    ]
  },
